      "summary": "Phase 1/3 — shippable: nền móng đứng cạnh UI cũ (không phá hiện trạng). DESIGN GATE ĐÃ XONG ngay lúc CREATE (front-load, kit 8b): user chọn hướng B Linear-referenced dark 2026-10-13 — hand-off docs/superpowers/designs/ui-redesign-direction.md (tokens + component props API đầy đủ), gate record direction-approved.md — SF-1 KHÔNG còn designer phase, implement thẳng theo hand-off. Việc còn lại: fe-shared src/styles (tokens+base @layer) + src/ui primitives (Badge/EmptyState/Skeleton/Spinner theo props API hand-off); rspack css rule ×3 + react/jsx-runtime shared ×3 + spike duplicate-react chạy SỚM (fallback class-only); cssFilename contenthash; standalone :4001/:4002 import base+tokens; tests primitives ở shell/tests. Demo: standalone 2 remote có baseline style + trang demo primitives khớp hand-off. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/ui-redesign/sf-1.md",
