      "title": "Shell — layout, login, nav, remote fallback",
      "tier": 1,
      "summary": "Phase 2/3 — shippable: shell restyle theo hand-off SF-1 (không gate mock riêng — direction đã user-duyệt). Layout container + header; NavBar active state (aria-current) + responsive ≤768px + user chip; HomePage dashboard + quick links + demo hints; LoginPage card (behavior + error messages giữ); RemoteSlot Suspense fallback = Skeleton + error fallback giữ text contract; styles.css rewrite scoped. Demo: login → nav active → dashboard → kill remote thấy fallback đẹp. Context pack: docs/superpowers/contexts/ui-redesign/sf-2.md",
